-- Demo data for a fresh project or a local stack.
--
-- Dumped from the live project (sxsbeavdmfuznigslfnp) and replayable on top of
-- the migrations in ./migrations. Every statement is idempotent: rows that
-- already exist are left alone, so running it against the live project is a
-- no-op.
--
-- Deliberately NOT included:
--   · auth.users / app_users — accounts are created through the invite-user
--     Edge Function (see functions/invite-user), never with a password that
--     sits in a public repository.
--   · Every column that points at a person (created_by, owner_id, assignee_id,
--     author_id, published_by, ...) — those users do not exist in a fresh
--     project, so the references are left null.
--   · org_settings.secrets — write-only, never returned by any API, and never
--     written to a file.
--   · Telemetry, audit log, rule runs, preview tokens.
--
-- Run:  psql "$DATABASE_URL" -f platform/supabase/seed.sql

